– QatarEnergy LNG N(2) (formerly Qatargas 2): TotalEnergies holds a 16.7% interest in train 5, which has a production capacity of 8 Mt/y of LNG;

In the United Arab Emirates , TotalEnergies holds a 5% stake in ADNOC LNG (nominal capacity of 6 Mt/y), a company that processes associated gas supplied by ADNOC Offshore to produce LNG, LPG and condensates, as well as a 5% stake in National Gas Shipping Company (NGSCO), a company responsible for chartering ships and providing logistics for ADNOC LNG’s needs.

