The occurrence and scale of incidents related to political, geopolitical, economic, health or social instability in certain strategic geographical areas or countries may be unpredictable. Such incidents are likely to adversely affect operating conditions, generate cost increases and lead to a significant decline in production, delays in and even halting of certain projects, or the loss of market shares. Such incidents may also expose employees and jeopardize their safety, as well as that of TotalEnergies’ facilities. These risks may have an adverse impact on TotalEnergies’ operating income and financial condition.

